From: Ayman Ragab <aymanrar2c@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8250-xiaomi-pipa: Add front camera suspend pinctrl

The front hi846 sensor node only had a default pinctrl state. Add suspend
pinctrl (mclk3_suspend + camera_front_suspend) matching the rear camera
pattern from OV13B10 fix, so power/reset GPIOs are driven correctly when
the sensor is idle and when switching between front and rear cameras.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts
index cd62403d2924..a8b3c1d4e5f6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts
@@ -675,7 +675,8 @@ camera_front: camera@20 {
 		reset-gpios = <&tlmm 109 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
 		pinctrl-0 = <&mclk3_active &camera_front_active>;
-		pinctrl-names = "default";
+		pinctrl-1 = <&mclk3_suspend &camera_front_suspend>;
+		pinctrl-names = "default", "suspend";
 
 		orientation = <0>; /* Front facing */
 		rotation = <270>;
